# Superseded checkpoints. The current ones (mlp.pth, cnn.pth) and the exported
# graphs (mlp.onnx, cnn.onnx) ARE committed — 600 KB total — so a fresh clone
# runs and its tests pass with no training step and no network. That is a
# deliberate exception for models this small; production still resolves the
# artifacts from the model registry via WEIGHTS_URI, and the container image
# never bakes them in (see .dockerignore).
mlp20.pth
cnn20.pth
